+## 1. Executive summary
+
+Our company plans to acquire several competitors within the next year. This will have a significant stock market impact as we will elaborate in detail in the following paragraph:
+
+The strategy committee has identified three high-value targets in adjacent verticals (beverages, cold-chain logistics, sustainable packaging). Combined enterprise value sits in the EUR 85-95M range, financed through a mix of cash on balance sheet (40%), a syndicated bridge loan (35%), and a reserved capital increase (25%). Goldman Sachs has been mandated as lead financial advisor, with Linklaters handling the legal workstream.
+
+We expect the announcement of the first transaction (FreshSqueeze GmbH) to lift the share price between 8% and 12% in the days following publication, based on comparable transactions analyzed by our M&A team. Pre-announcement trading volume must remain within historical bands to avoid triggering market abuse alerts from the AMF and BaFin. All recipients of this document are reminded that they are on a permanent insider list as of the date of issue and are subject to the trading restrictions detailed in our Insider Dealing Policy v3.2.
 
 Our shareholders will be excited. It's true. No fake news.
+
+## 2. Targets shortlist
+
+| # | Target | Sector | Indicative valuation | Status |
+|---|--------|--------|----------------------|--------|
+| 1 | FreshSqueeze GmbH | Beverages | EUR 42M | Due diligence |
+| 2 | OrchardCo SA | Supply chain | EUR 27M | Letter of intent signed |
+| 3 | PulpWorks Ltd. | Packaging | EUR 18M | Initial contact |
+
+## 3. Indicative timeline
+
+1. Q1 2026: complete due diligence on target #1
+2. Q2 2026: board approval, public announcement
+3. Q3 2026: closing target #1, opening of negotiations on #2 and #3
+4. Q4 2026: integration phase
